    "Description": ".NET Core is a managed-software framework. It implements a subset of the .NET\nframework APIs and several new APIs, and it includes a CLR implementation.\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update .NET 8.0 to SDK 8.0.110 and Runtime 8.0.10 [rhel-9.5.z] (RHEL-60801)Bug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* Update .NET 8.0 to SDK 8.0.110 and Runtime 8.0.10 [rhel-9.5.z] (JIRA:RHEL-60801)\n\n* dotnet8.0: Multiple .NET components susceptible to hash flooding [rhel-9.5] (JIRA:RHEL-61011)\n\n* dotnet8.0: Denial of Service in System.Text.Json [rhel-9.5] (JIRA:RHEL-61021)\n\n* dotnet8.0: System.IO.Packaging - Multiple DoS vectors in use of SortedList [rhel-9.5] (JIRA:RHEL-61028)\n\n* dotnet8.0: kestrel: closing an HTTP/3 stream can cause a race condition and lead to remote code execution [rhel-9.5] (JIRA:RHEL-61373)\n\n* dotnet8.0: nodejs-ws: denial of service when handling a request with many HTTP headers [rhel-9] (JIRA:RHEL-43156)",
